Adwaita's scalable cursors, as gnome-shell 51.1 ships them
(data/cursor-theme/icons/Adwaita/cursors_scalable, commit 32f76879 and later).

By Jakub Steiner for the GNOME project. Each SVG carries its license in its
metadata: the MIT License.

`build.rs` embeds this directory into the synoik binary; `src/cursor.rs` reads it.
